  "decision": "As KerML 8.2.4.3.1 states it: the TYPED_BY terminal, then one OwnedFeatureTyping. TYPED_BY is one of the special lexical terminals of KerML 8.2.2.7, `':' | 'typed' 'by'`, and the rule writes it out as that choice. This is the KerML variant (ADR-0014). SysML uses its DEFINED_BY terminal, `':' | 'defined' 'by'`, and a FeatureTyping. The Xtext fragment writes the same expansion.",
